      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is the Hanoten Teshua formula of the Prayer for the Wellbeing of the Government as translated by Artur Carlos de Barros Basto in Portuguese on page 34 of his Shabbat morning prayer-pamphlet <tei:hi rend="italic">Oração Matinal de Shabbath</tei:hi> (1939). I have set Barros Basto’s Portuguese translation side-by-side with the Hebrew text of Hanoten Teshua (the variation of the prayer corresponding to Barros Basto’s translation).</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_52278_notes"/>
